          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "[答案]: 解令  $ t = \\sin^{2} x $，则  $ \\mathrm{d}t = 2 \\sin x \\cos x \\, \\mathrm{d}x, \\sin^{4} x + \\cos^{4} x = 2t^{2} - 2t + 1 $，则",
          "block_bbox": [
