        {
          "block_label": "display_formula",
          "block_content": " $$  原式 =\\frac{1}{2}\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}}\\frac{1}{2t^{2}-2t-4}\\mathrm{d}t=\\frac{1}{12}\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}}\\left(\\frac{1}{t-2}-\\frac{1}{t+1}\\right)\\mathrm{d}t=-\\frac{\\ln2}{12} $$ ",
